            H("Proxy repositories"),
            P("Add an upstream with the **Go module proxy** preset (`https://proxy.golang.org`), or the address of Athens, Artifactory or another module proxy, allow it for the space, then create a proxy repository with it. Module files are fetched on first request and kept; version lists, `@latest` and branch or commit queries (`@v/main.info`) are re-checked after the metadata age. Checksum-database requests (`sumdb/`) pass through to the upstream, so `GOSUMDB` keeps working through Depotex. Downloads are still checked by the go command against `go.sum` and the checksum database."),
            H("In the artifact browser"),
            P("Modules show by path, then their versions with their files (`.zip`, `.mod`, `.info`). The **Install** bar shows `go get` for the version, with the repository as `GOPROXY`."),
